herolte: herostep ladder without DISP0, domains restored when the screen is on (0459, D-0098)

E-0302 (min86): the six small domains -50 mA, audio -5, G3D -35; DISP0 half-powers the display. E-0304/E-0307: stopping the DECON (herodisp=2) already takes the screen-off current from ~520 to ~368 mA. herostep=<s> (s >= 10) now gates, with the screen off, only the six small domains (30 s after off), audio (+s) and G3D (+2s); the config of each is saved and, when the screen is on again, written back in reverse order waiting for the status (logged "HEROLTE PD: restore"); the ladder re-arms for the next off. herostep only.

